license: "MIT"

keywords:
  - "side-scan sonar"
  - "object detection"
  - "YOLOv8"
  - "confidence calibration"
  - "reliability"
  - "conformal risk control"
  - "selective prediction"
  - "underwater AI"

abstract: >
  AquaTrust is a reliability-aware decision framework for side-scan sonar
  object detection. It augments detector confidence with auxiliary evidence,
  calibrated reliability estimation, and conformal risk control to support
  risk-aware autonomous acceptance or human review.
